<section class="ac-shell ac-clinical-workflow" aria-label="Altered Carbon clinical and Virtual procedures">
  <div class="ac-page-title"><div><span class="ac-kicker">DHF OPERATIONS // 2020 CORE</span><h1>Clinical & Virtual Console</h1></div><p>Drug administration, addiction, metabolization, medical rest, Ego integrity and Virtual protocols. Deterministic mechanics are calculated; narrative decisions remain with the GM.</p></div>
  <article class="ac-panel"><header class="ac-panel-title"><span>Patient / Operative</span><small>OWNED ACTORS</small></header><div class="ac-clinical-select">{{#each actors}}<button type="button" data-action="selectActor" data-actor-id="{{id}}" class="{{#if selected}}active{{/if}}">{{name}}</button>{{else}}<p class="ac-muted">No editable character Actors are available.</p>{{/each}}</div></article>
  {{#if hasActor}}
  <div class="ac-clinical-columns">
    <article class="ac-panel"><header class="ac-panel-title"><span>Drugs & Addiction</span><small>{{activeCount}} ACTIVE</small></header>
      <div class="ac-clinical-select">{{#each drugs}}<button type="button" data-action="selectDrug" data-drug-id="{{id}}" class="{{#if selected}}active{{/if}}">{{name}} <small>x{{doses}}{{#if active}} · ACTIVE{{/if}}</small></button>{{else}}<p class="ac-muted">Add Drug Items using the official Rules Browser.</p>{{/each}}</div>
      {{#if drug}}<div class="ac-record-facts three"><div><span>Formulation</span><strong>{{drug.name}}</strong></div><div><span>State</span><strong>{{drug.phase}}</strong></div><div><span>Endurance tests</span><strong>{{drug.metabolismChecks}}</strong></div><div><span>Metabolism +</span><strong>{{drug.metabolismSuccesses}}</strong></div><div><span>Addicted</span><strong>{{#if drug.addicted}}Yes{{else}}No{{/if}}</strong></div><div><span>Hangover</span><strong>{{drug.hangover}}h</strong></div></div>
      {{#if drug.controlledTier}}<p class="ac-help-line">Controlled Substance — {{drug.controlledBy}} Tier {{drug.controlledTier}}. Licensing and illicit access require GM verification.</p>{{/if}}
      {{#if canOperate}}<div class="ac-record-actions">{{#unless drug.isBios}}<button type="button" data-action="administer" {{#if drug.active}}disabled{{/if}}>Administer</button>{{#if drug.addictionRisk}}<button type="button" data-action="addiction">Addiction Test</button>{{/if}}{{#if drug.addicted}}<button type="button" data-action="craving">Resist Craving</button>{{/if}}<button type="button" data-action="metabolize" {{#unless drug.active}}disabled{{/unless}}>Endurance: Round</button>{{/unless}}{{#if drug.hangover}}<button type="button" data-action="hangover">Advance Hangover</button>{{/if}}{{#if isGM}}<button type="button" data-action="forceClear">GM Override: Clear</button>{{/if}}</div>{{/if}}
      {{/if}}
      <div class="ac-record-actions"><button type="button" data-action="encounterEnd">End Encounter: Clear Passed Drugs</button><button type="button" data-action="reaperMove">Record Reaper Move Poison</button></div>
    </article>
    <article class="ac-panel"><header class="ac-panel-title"><span>Medical & Ego</span><small>ORGANIC + DHF</small></header>
      <div class="ac-record-facts three"><div><span>Ego</span><strong>{{egoValue}} / {{egoEffectiveMax}}</strong></div><div><span>Base Max</span><strong>{{egoMax}}</strong></div><div><span>Permanent Loss</span><strong>{{egoPermanentLoss}}</strong></div></div>
      <p class="ac-help-line">Natural rest uses the Endurance/Toughness check. Rapid Regrowth Bios is consumed as an additional treatment. Permanent EP loss lowers the recoverable maximum.</p>
      {{#if canOperate}}<div class="ac-record-actions"><button type="button" data-action="rest">Medical Rest / Treatment</button>{{#if hasBioWelder}}<button type="button" data-action="bioWelder">Bio Welder (Tissue/Bone Weld)</button>{{/if}}{{#if medicalAftereffectHours}}<button type="button" data-action="advanceMedical">Advance Painkiller Aftereffects ({{medicalAftereffectHours}}h)</button>{{/if}}<button type="button" data-action="egoEvent">Apply Ego-Loss Event</button>{{#if isGM}}<button type="button" data-action="restoreEgo">GM: Restore EP</button>{{/if}}</div>{{/if}}
      {{#if isGM}}<div class="ac-record-actions"><button type="button" data-action="firstAid">Medicine / First Aid</button>{{#if hasFieldMedic}}<button type="button" data-action="fieldMedic">Field Medic: Expert First Aid (+)</button>{{/if}}<button type="button" data-action="psychosurgery">Psychosurgery</button><button type="button" data-action="interrogation">Interrogation / Virus</button><button type="button" data-action="viralStrike">Viral Strike</button></div>{{/if}}
      <p class="ac-help-line">Psychosurgery and Interrogation require the software record and a patient projected into Virtual. GM verifies opposed checks and source-specific triggered effects.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
  <article class="ac-panel"><header class="ac-panel-title"><span>Virtual / Simulspace</span><small>{{#if virtual.active}}PROJECTED{{else}}REALSPACE{{/if}}</small></header>
    <div class="ac-record-facts four"><div><span>Training Bonus Pool</span><strong>{{virtualBonusPool}}</strong></div><div><span>Training Choices Used</span><strong>{{virtualTrainingChoiceCount}}</strong></div><div><span>State</span><strong>{{#if virtual.active}}IN VIRTUAL{{else}}REALSPACE{{/if}}</strong></div><div><span>Resolution</span><strong>{{virtual.resolution}}</strong></div><div><span>Purpose</span><strong>{{virtual.purpose}}</strong></div><div><span>Time Band</span><strong>{{virtual.timeBand}}</strong></div><div><span>Ratio</span><strong>{{virtual.timeRatio}}</strong></div><div><span>Resolved Exposures</span><strong>{{virtual.exposures}}</strong></div></div>
    <p class="ac-help-line">Physical sleeve capabilities are replaced with Willpower / Acuity in Virtual. Medium and High resolution grant program bonus dice. Discipline mitigates time-induced Ego loss.</p>
    {{#if canOperate}}<div class="ac-record-actions"><button type="button" data-action="enterVirtual" {{#if virtual.active}}disabled{{/if}}>Enter Virtual</button><button type="button" data-action="virtualExposure" {{#unless virtual.active}}disabled{{/unless}}>Resolve Time Exposure</button>{{#if isGM}}{{#if virtualBonusPool}}<button type="button" data-action="clearTrainingPool">Clear Expired Training Bonus</button>{{/if}}<button type="button" data-action="virtualTraining" {{#unless virtual.active}}disabled{{/unless}}>GM: Instruction Reward</button>{{/if}}<button type="button" data-action="exitVirtual" {{#unless virtual.active}}disabled{{/unless}}>Return to Realspace</button></div>{{/if}}
  </article>
  {{else}}<p class="ac-callout">Open this console from a character sheet, or select an owned Actor above.</p>{{/if}}
  <p class="ac-help-line">Published source: Altered Carbon RPG Core Rulebook (2020), pp. 138–147, 248–253, 310–315. The system does not infer unlisted outcomes, hidden dosages, or GM determinations. Consult the v1.7 clinical implementation and runtime test documents for limitations.</p>
</section>
